grid.spec.ts\n│   └── search.spec.ts\n├── netlify/\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── amenities.ts\n│       ├── auth.ts\n│       ├── bookings.ts\n│       ├── db.ts\n│       ├── favorites.ts\n│       ├── host-bookings.ts\n│       ├── host-listings.ts\n│       ├── host-stats.ts\n│       ├── properties.ts\n│       ├── property-images.ts\n│       ├── reviews.ts\n│       └── users.ts\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── check.ts\n│   ├── deploy.ts\n│   ├── schema.ts\n│   └── seed-db.ts\n├── docs/\n│   └── tests.md\n├── playwright.config.ts\n├── package.json\n├── package-lock.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── vite.config.ts\n└── AppSpec.md\n```\n\n### 2. DOCS/TESTS.MD - FILTERS SECTION CONTENT\n\nThe complete filters section is divided into three main subsections:\n\n#### **A. FiltersPanel Component Tests** (Lines 249-312)\n\nTests for the collapsible filters panel that opens from a button on the home page:\n\n- **Test: Filters panel is hidden by default with a visible toggle button**\n  - Initial: Home page (`/`)\n  - Expected: Collapsed panel, visible \"Filters\" button with filter icon\n\n- **Test: Clicking the Filters button opens the filters panel**\n  - Opens panel revealing: price range slider, bedrooms selector, beds selector, bathrooms selector, amenity checkboxes grouped by category\n\n- **Test: Clicking the Filters button again closes the filters panel**\n  - Collapses/hides, preserves previously applied filters\n\n- **Test: Price range slider filters properties by price per night**\n  - Initial: Properties exist with prices $50, $100, $200, $500\n  - Action: Set slider min=$75, max=$250\n  - Expected: Only $100 and $200 properties show\n\n- **Test: Bedrooms minimum filter works correctly**\n  - Properties with 1, 2, 3, 5 bedrooms exist\n  - Action: Set bedrooms minimum to 3\n  - Expected: Only 3+ bedroom properties show\n\n- **Test: Beds minimum filter works correctly**\n  - Action: Set beds minimum to 2\n  - Expected: Only 2+ bed properties show\n\n- **Test: Bathrooms minimum filter works correctly**\n  - Action: Set bathrooms minimum to 2\n  - Expected: Only 2+ bathroom properties show\n\n- **Test: Amenity checkboxes filter properties by selected amenities**\n  - Amenities include: WiFi, Pool, Kitchen, Parking\n  - Action: Check WiFi and Pool\n  - Expected: Only properties with BOTH amenities show\n\n- **Test: Amenity checkboxes are grouped by category**\n  - Expected groups: \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\"\n\n- **Test: Multiple filters combine with AND logic**\n  - Action: Set price $100-$300, bedrooms ≥2, WiFi checked\n  - Expected: Only properties matching ALL three conditions show\n\n- **Test: Filters combine with search bar and category filter**\n  - Combines location search (Paris), category (Apartment), and filters (bedrooms ≥2)\n  - Expected: Filtered results use all three filter mechanisms\n\n- **Test: Resetting filters shows all properties**\n  - Via \"Clear Filters\" or \"Reset\" button\n  - All controls return to default state\n\n- **Test: Filters panel controls are functional on repeated use**\n  - Multiple interactions with different combinations work correctly\n\n#### **B. CategoryFilter Component Tests** (Lines 142-175)\n\nTests for the horizontal chip-based property type filter:\n\n- **Test: Category filter bar displays all property type chips**\n  - Types: Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n  - No chip selected by default\n\n- **Test: Clicking a category chip filters properties by that type**\n  - Chip becomes visually selected (highlighted)\n\n- **Test: Clicking the selected category chip deselects it and shows all properties**\n  - Returns to unselected appearance\n\n- **Test: Switching between category chips updates the filter**\n  - Can toggle between different categories\n\n- **Test: Category filter works in combination with search bar**\n  - Combines location search with category filtering\n\n- **Test: Category filter bar is horizontally scrollable when chips overflow**\n  - On narrow viewports, scrollable with left/right navigation\n\n- **Test: Category chip is functional on repeated use**\n  - Multiple selections, deselections, and switches work correctly\n\n#### **C. SearchBar Filtering Tests** (Lines 97-116)\n\nTests for location/date/guest filtering:\n\n- **Test: Search by location filters property results**\n- **Test: Search by check-in and check-out dates filters results**\n- **Test: Search by guest count filters results**\n- **Test: Combined search with all fields filters results**\n\n#### **D. Pagination with Filters** (Lines 347-356)\n\n- **Test: Applying filters resets pagination to page 1**\n  - When user on page 3, applies a filter → goes to page 1 of filtered results\n\n### 3. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIG\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n- **Test directory:** `./tests`\n- **Timeout:** 60 seconds per test\n- **Expect timeout:** 10 seconds\n- **Configuration:**\n  - `fullyParallel: false` (sequential execution)\n  - `forbidOnly: true` (no skipped tests)\n  - `retries: 0`\n  - `workers: 1`\n- **Reporters:** \n  - Replay.io reporter (upload: false)\n  - JSON reporter (`test-results/results.json`)\n  - HTML reporter (never open)\n- **Use settings:**\n  - Device: Replay Chromium\n  - Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n  - Trace: `on-first-retry`\n  - Action timeout: 15 seconds\n- **Web server:** Netlify dev on port 8888\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`\n\n1. **auth.spec.ts** - Authentication tests\n2. **search.spec.ts** - SearchBar tests (7 tests covering location, dates, guests, combined search)\n3. **property-grid.spec.ts** - PropertyGrid & PropertyCard tests (7 tests)\n4. **category-filter.spec.ts** - CategoryFilter tests (7 tests)\n5. **favorite-button.spec.ts** - FavoriteButton tests\n\n### 5. MAIN FILTER-RELATED COMPONENTS\n\n#### **FiltersPanel.tsx** (Lines 1-254)\n- **Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FiltersPanel.tsx`\n- **Props