ponents/PropertyGrid.tsx`\n- **Props:** `properties: Property[]`, `loading: boolean`\n- **Features:**\n  - Loading spinner (Loader2 icon)\n  - Empty state message when no properties: \"No properties found\" + \"Try adjusting your filters or search criteria\"\n  - Responsive grid: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4`\n- **Data-testids:** `property-grid-loading`, `property-grid-empty`, `property-grid`\n\n#### **Pagination.tsx** (Lines 1-72)\n- **Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx`\n- **Props:** `currentPage`, `totalPages`, `onPageChange(page: number)`\n- **Logic:**\n  - Hides if totalPages ≤ 1\n  - Shows page numbers up to 7; if more, shows smart ellipsis (1, ..., current-1, current, current+1, ..., last)\n  - Previous button disabled on page 1\n  - Next button disabled on last page\n- **Data-testids:** `pagination`, `pagination-previous`, `pagination-next`, `pagination-page-${page}`\n\n#### **Pagination - Responsive Grid:** \n- `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4` with 6px gap\n\n### 6. HOME PAGE (Integration)\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx` (Lines 1-102)\n\n- **Integration:** Combines all filter components\n- **Dispatch actions:**\n  - `handleSearch()` - calls `setFilters()` with city/checkIn/checkOut/guests, resets page to 1\n  - `handleCategorySelect()` - calls `setFilters()` with propertyType, resets page to 1\n  - `handleApplyFilters()` - calls `setFilters()` with price/bedrooms/beds/bathrooms/amenities, resets page to 1\n  - `handleResetFilters()` - calls `resetFilters()`\n  - `handlePageChange()` - calls `setPage()`, scrolls to top\n- **Effects:**\n  - Fetches properties whenever filters change\n  - Fetches user favorites on load if logged in\n- **Layout:** SearchBar → CategoryFilter (flex-1) + FiltersPanel → PropertyGrid → Pagination\n\n### 7. REDUX STATE MANAGEMENT\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts` (Lines 1-187)\n\n#### **SearchFilters Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface SearchFilters {\n  city: string\n  checkIn: string\n  checkOut: string\n  guests: number\n  propertyType: string\n  minPrice: number\n  maxPrice: number\n  minBedrooms: number\n  minBeds: number\n  minBathrooms: number\n  amenityIds: string[]\n  page: number\n}\n```\n\n#### **Initial Filters:**\n```typescript\nconst initialFilters: SearchFilters = {\n  city: '',\n  checkIn: '',\n  checkOut: '',\n  guests: 0,\n  propertyType: '',\n  minPrice: 0,\n  maxPrice: 0,\n  minBedrooms: 0,\n  minBeds: 0,\n  minBathrooms: 0,\n  amenityIds: [],\n  page: 1,\n}\n```\n\n#### **Async Thunk - fetchProperties:**\n- Builds query params from filter object\n- Endpoint: `/api/properties?${params}`\n- Returns: `{ properties: Property[], total: number, page: number, totalPages: number }`\n- Only includes params if non-zero/non-empty\n\n#### **Actions:**\n- `setFilters(payload: Partial<SearchFilters>)` - merges partial filters\n- `resetFilters()` - resets to initial state\n- `setPage(payload: number)` - updates page number\n\n#### **Property Type:**\n```typescript\ninterface Property {\n  id, host_id, title, description, property_type,\n  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, max_guests,\n  bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, address, city, state, country,\n  latitude, longitude, check_in_time, check_out_time,\n  is_active, created_at, updated_at,\n  // Optional fields\n  main_image?, avg_rating?, review_count?,\n  host_name?, host_avatar?, host_bio?, host_since?, host_listing_count?,\n  images?, amenities?, reviews?\n}\n```\n\n### 8. SEED DATA\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (Lines 1-319)\n\n#### **Users (4):**\n1. Sarah Chen (host, sarah@example.com) - Superhost\n2. Mike Johnson (host, mike@example.com) - Austin\n3. Emma Wilson (guest, emma@example.com)\n4. Alex Rivera (guest, alex@example.com)\n\n#### **Properties (5):**\n1. **Cozy Downtown Loft** (Loft, $150/night, 1 bed, 2 beds, 1 bath)\n   - New York, NY, United States\n   - Amenities: WiFi, Kitchen, AC, Heating, TV, Smoke alarm\n   - 1 review: 5.0 rating\n\n2. **Beachfront Villa with Private Pool** (Villa, $450/night, 4 beds, 5 beds, 3 bath)\n   - Miami, FL, United States\n   - Amenities: WiFi, Kitchen, AC, Pool, Parking, Beachfront, Smoke alarm, CO alarm\n   - No reviews (shows \"New\")\n\n3. **Mountain Cabin Retreat** (Cabin, $200/night, 3 beds, 4 beds, 2 bath)\n   - Asheville, NC, United States\n   - Amenities: WiFi, Kitchen, Heating, Hot tub, Parking, Smoke alarm, First aid kit\n   - No reviews\n\n4. **Modern Austin Apartment** (Apartment, $120/night, 1 bed, 1 bed, 1 bath)\n   - Austin, TX, United States\n   - Amenities: WiFi, Kitchen, AC, Gym, Pool, Smoke alarm\n   - 1 review: 4.0 rating\n\n5. **Historic Townhouse in Georgetown** (Townhouse, $275/night, 3 beds, 3 beds, 2 bath)\n   - Washington, DC, United States\n   - Amenities: WiFi, Kitchen, AC, Heating, Washer, TV, Smoke alarm, CO alarm\n\n#### **Amenities (18 total):**\n\n**Essentials (6):**\n- WiFi, Kitchen, Air conditioning, Heating, Washer, TV\n\n**Features (5):**\n- Pool, Hot tub, Free parking, Gym, EV charger\n\n**Safety (4):**\n- Smoke alarm, Carbon monoxide alarm, First aid kit, Fire extinguisher\n\n**Location (3):**\n- Beachfront, Waterfront, Ski-in/Ski-out\n\n#### **Bookings (6):**\n- Mixed statuses: completed, confirmed, pending, cancelled\n- Date ranges from late 2025 to mid-2026\n\n#### **Reviews (2):**\n- NY Loft: 5.0 rating\n- Austin Apartment: 4.0 rating\n\n### 9. RESPONSE SCHEMA EXPECTATIONS\n\nFrom API calls, the properties endpoint returns:\n```json\n{\n  \"properties\": [Property[], ...],\n  \"total\": number,\n  \"page\": number,\n  \"totalPages\": number\n}\n```\n\n### 10. KEY DATA-TESTID PATTERNS\n\n**Filter Components:**\n- `filters-toggle` - Open/close button\n- `filters-panel` - The panel container\n- `filters-panel-container` - Outer wrapper\n- `filters-reset` - \"Clear all\" button\n- `filters-apply` - \"Show results\" button\n- `filter-min-price`, `filter-max-price`\n- `filter-min-bedrooms`, `filter-min-beds`, `filter-min-bathrooms`\n- `amenity-checkbox-${amenityId}`\n\n**Category Filter:**\n- `category-filter` - Container\n- `category-chip-${type}` - Individual chips\n\n**SearchBar:**\n- `search-bar` - Form container\n- `search-location`, `search-checkin`, `search-checkout`, `search-guests`, `search-button`\n\n**Property Grid:**\n- `property-grid` - Grid container\n- `property-grid-loading` - Loading spinner\n- `property-grid-empty` - No results message\n- `property-card-${propertyId}` - Individual cards\n- `property-type-badge-${propertyId}` - Type badge\n\n**Pagination:**\n- `pagination` - Container\n- `pagination-previous`, `pagination-next` - Navigation buttons\n- `pagination-page-${page}` - Page number buttons\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive exploration provides all the details about the Airbnb-clone app's filtering architecture, test specifications, component implementations, and seed data structure."}],"totalDurationMs":63117,"totalTokens":62662,"totalToolUseCount":22,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1267,"cache_read_input_tokens":55977,"output_tokens":5417,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1267},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
